{x_mailsorter
    {message
        output={@
You examine the mail sorter.
It is comprised of virtual slots, into which the incoming and outgoing mail
is sorted. This is done manually and via macros.

        }
    }
}

{x_mailsorter_slot
    {message
        output={@
You examine the mail sorter slots...
Each one is protected by a virtual bio-scanner.
Hacking into the slots would require an expert hacker.
If you could find one, you may be able to access other Shellspace users'
mail items.

        }
    }
}







{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_mail_sorter_slot))
    {act, logic=x_mailsorter_slot, tags=!_type|room }
}

{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_mail_sorter))
    {act, logic=x_mailsorter, tags=!_type|room }
}






